Z||000000||pontiacs4me||09-18-2001||07:00 PM||||A friend of mine is developing something you all will definately be interested in.  How would you all like to be able to run a 3 inch pulley, with no ping, and no knock retard on pump gas?  what he is building is a supercharger cooler.  Its like an intercooler, but instead of cooling the incoming air, it cools the supercharger itself, therefore reducing the incoming air temps as the result.  Check this out.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.gp-owners.com/forum/topic.asp?TOPIC_ID=6372391&FORUM_ID=1&CAT_ID=1&Topic_Title=My+%22NEW+MODS%22%2E%2E%2E&Forum_Title=ClubGP+%2D+General" TARGET=_blank>http://www.gp-owners.com/forum/topic.asp?TOPIC_ID=6372391&FORUM_ID=1&CAT_ID=1&Topic_Title=My+%22NEW+MODS%22%2E%2E%2E&Forum_Title=ClubGP+%2D+General</A> ||||reg||1
