Z||000002||lildevil||09-18-2001||10:08 PM||||I'd be interested. Been reading about it on the GPforum. But i would like to see some dyno results and some feed back from customers. Unless he needs some one to test it...hint hint hint  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Earl Sessions<BR>1985 Fiero w/ 1998 Supercharged 3.8 V-6<BR>Best ET: 13.232 @ 101.24 mph<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/water3quarterthumb.jpg"> ||||reg||1
